konoma canvas demo
This file is opened by a demo plugin that runs as a program of its own (`crates/konoma-demo-clock`).
Its first line is the title of the frame you see. To look at it:
  cargo build -p konoma-demo-clock
  konoma --plugin target/debug/konoma-demo-clock samples/demo.konoma-demo
The plugin draws every cell itself (a gauge that moves each second, a picture where the
terminal can show pixels, a line editor on `i`). Original content for konoma, MIT like the rest.
